To **add** a positive integer: move **right**.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta}
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (-4.2,0) -- (4.2,0);
\foreach \v in {-3,...,3} {\draw (\v,0.15) -- (\v,-0.15);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.15) {$0$};
\fill (-2,0) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below] at (-2,-0.15) {$a$};
\draw[-{Stealth}] (-2,0.2) to[bend left=40] (1,0.2);
\node[above] at (-0.5,1) {add $b$: move right};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

To **subtract** a positive integer: move **left**.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta}
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (-4.2,0) -- (4.2,0);
\foreach \v in {-3,...,3} {\draw (\v,0.15) -- (\v,-0.15);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.15) {$0$};
\fill (2,0) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below] at (2,-0.15) {$a$};
\draw[-{Stealth}] (2,0.2) to[bend right=40] (-1,0.2);
\node[above] at (0.5,1) {subtract $b$: move left};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

